==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aɪn}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive|business}} To transfer to the custody of, usually for sale, transport, or [[safekeeping]].
# {{transitive}} To entrust to the care of another.
# {{transitive}} To send to a final destination.

